# Quest Subgraph Study Mechanic

  ## Summary

  Replace the current “every node is a goal” study picker with a quest-target model. A quest is learner-facing UI around a technical
  target concept. The Study Session remains target-scoped; the visible graph becomes a limited quest subgraph instead of the whole
  Derived Graph Layer by default.

  This keeps goal-guided mastery behavior while fixing the confusing “many goals, same graph” UX. The direction is consistent with
  cognitive-load guidance for small focused chunks, mastery-learning feedback tied to goals, and goal-oriented learning-path work.
